\pard\b0\par
\pard\b Steps\par
\pard 1. Open \b Command Wall\b0 .\par
\pard 2. Choose the wall layout your site uses.\par
\pard 3. Drag devices from the roster into panels when the screen allows it (live starts when assigned).\par
