\pard\b 21. CAD / RMS\par
\pard\b0\par
\pard\b Purpose\par
\pard \b CAD / RMS\b0  is an optional integration with Computer-Aided Dispatch and Records Management systems. Use this tab only when your site license includes it.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Steps\par
\pard 1. Open \b CAD / RMS\b0 .\par
\pard 2. If licensed, use the incident workspace shown.\par
