\pard\b 22. Settings for operators\par
\pard\b0\par
\pard\b Steps\par
\pard 1. Open \b Settings\b0 .\par
\pard 2. Use only the options your role allows.\par
\pard 3. If \b Server Config\b0  is read-only, that is normal for operators \emdash ask a super administrator for network or camera registration changes.\par
\pard 4. Click \b Sign out\b0  at the end of your shift (from the account / password change area or logout control your site shows).\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Important\par
\pard Do not change Device registration, SIP, or portal URL settings unless you are trained and authorised. Wrong values take cameras offline for everyone.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard [Insert screenshot: Settings for operator]\par
