\pard\b 23. Troubleshooting\par
\pard\b0\par
\pard\b Sign-in\par
\pard 1. Meet password rules on \b Change your password\b0 .\par
\pard 2. After first change, stop using \b global123\b0 .\par
\pard 3. Recheck account and dashboard address; ask IT if still blocked.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Devices and live video\par
\pard 1. Device offline \emdash power, then ask administrator.\par
\pard 2. No live video \emdash confirm \b Online\b0 , retry \b Pin\b0 , wait, then ask IT.\par
\pard 3. \b PTT\b0  not heard \emdash hold the button; confirm the correct device.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b SOS\par
\pard 1. Banner gone but work unfinished \emdash check incident policy and \b Acknowledge\b0  history with a supervisor.\par
\pard 2. Incomplete helper list \emdash other units may be offline.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Evidence\par
\pard 1. File missing in \b Evidence Library\b0  \emdash search again; ask a super administrator about indexing or dock upload.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Licensed tabs locked\par
\pard Ask your administrator about license entitlements.\par
\pard\sa360\par

\pard\b 24. Daily workflow\par
\pard\b0\par
\pard\b Start of shift\par
\pard 1. \b Sign in\b0\par
\pard 2. Open \b Operations\b0\par
\pard 3. Check online devices\par
\pard 4. Test one \b Pin\b0  live view if required\par
\pard 5. Confirm \b PTT\b0  readiness if required\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b During an incident\par
\pard 1. Find the unit in \b Devices\b0\par
\pard 2. Open video with \b Pin\b0\par
\pard 3. Check map position\par
\pard 4. Use \b PTT\b0  or \b Call\b0\par
\pard 5. Use \b Acknowledge\b0  for SOS when policy requires it\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b End of shift\par
\pard 1. Close live panels you opened\par
\pard 2. \b Sign out\b0\par
\pard\sa360\par

